            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wikimedia Commons: “Beautiful adhan” (CC0), “Azan” oleh Andrewler (CC BY-SA 4.0), “The Adhan – Aaqib Azeez” diunggah oleh Atcovi (CC BY-SA 4.0, kenyaringan disesuaikan)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
